      <h1 class="mission-title">Our Mission</h1>
      <p class="mission-text">We believe art should be as discoverable as knowledge itself.<br/>
Our platform was created to make the world of art more open, connected, and accessible — a place where anyone can explore artists, uncover artworks, and discover where those works live across museums, galleries, collections, and public spaces around the globe.<br/><br/>
Art history is scattered across institutions, archives, and private collections.<br/>
We bring it together into one searchable experience: a living map of creativity across cultures, generations, and movements.<br/><br/>
Whether you are a curious visitor, collector, student, researcher, or lifelong art lover, our mission is to help you find meaningful connections through art effortlessly.<br/><br/>
We envision a future where discovering a masterpiece is as simple as searching the web. A future where every artwork has context, every artist has visibility, and every person has access to the stories behind human creativity.<br/>
By combining technology, discovery, and cultural knowledge, we aim to become the world's most trusted gateway to art.</p>
